Feature: Pet Store CRUD Operations\n\n  Scenario: Create a new pet\n    Given the API endpoint is \"https://petstore.swagger.io/v2/pet\"\n    When a POST request is sent with the following pet data:\n      | id    | name  | status |\n      | 12345 | Fluffy | available |\n    Then the response status code should be 200\n    And the pet should be created successfully\n\n  Scenario: Retrieve pet details\n    Given the API endpoint is \"https://petstore.swagger.io/v2/pet/12345\"\n    When a GET request is sent\n    Then the response status code should be 200\n    And the pet name should be \"Fluffy\"\n\n  Scenario: Update pet details\n    Given the API endpoint is \"https://petstore.swagger.io/v2/pet\"\n    When a PUT request is sent with the following updated pet data:\n      | id    | name  | status |\n      | 12345 | Fluffy | sold |\n    Then the response status code should be 200\n    And the pet status should be \"sold\"\n\n  Scenario: Delete a pet\n    Given the API endpoint is \"https://petstore.swagger.io/v2/pet/12345\"\n    When a DELETE request is sent\n    Then the response status code should be 200\n    And the pet should be deleted successfully